  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACP-EU CULTURE PROGRAMME (CARIBBEAN)
Creative Caribbean: an Ecosystem of &#xbf;Play&#xbf; for growth and development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific objectives (i.e. outcomes): 1.Strengthened and rationalised ecosystem development framework (including entrepreneurial capacity &amp; strategic business planning) for the cultural and creative sectors in the region;2.Increased creation and production of quality globally competitive goods and services, at competitive prices for access to local, regional and international markets as well as the creation of new jobs;3.Expanded skills which enable participants to self-generate the cash flow to fuel their growth as well as increased access to financing through innovative mechanisms that allow co-financing and reduce the Caribbeans cultural operators dependency on international financing.</narrative>
  </description>
